        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I can’t say enough good things about this dog grooming experience! My dog came in smelling awful and had so many knots in her fur, I honestly wasn’t sure how they were going to handle it. But Katie and Lucio, the amazing owners, worked their magic!\n\nNot only did they take me in last minute (a miracle in itself!), but they were so kind, professional, and clearly passionate about what they do. My dog came out looking like a brand-new pup—clean, fluffy, tangle-free, and smelling amazing! She was happy and calm when I picked her up, which tells me she was treated with love and care.\n\nIt’s rare to find people this dedicated and talented. I’m so grateful to have found them and will 100% be going back. Thank you, Katie and Lucio!",
